## Examples

Example 1 — genre split, then focus, then semantic axis:
```json
{
  "intent_description": "Split the catalogue by genre, zoom into drama films, then arrange them along a spectrum from emotionally overwhelming to emotionally restrained.",
  "operations": [
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "genre"},
    {"op": "focus",   "concept": "drama films"},
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "emotionally overwhelming vs emotionally restrained", "kind": "axis", "space": "semantic"}
  ]
}
```

Example 2 — decade split, then focus, then open-ended axis:
```json
{
  "intent_description": "Split the catalogue by decade, look at 1990s films, then explore how much narrative ambiguity each film carries.",
  "operations": [
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "decade"},
    {"op": "focus",   "concept": "1990s films"},
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "degree of narrative ambiguity", "kind": "open_ended"}
  ]
}
```

Example 3 — runtime split, then focus, then visual axis:
```json
{
  "intent_description": "Start with films organised by runtime, focus on the shorter ones, then spread them along a visual warmth spectrum.",
  "operations": [
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "runtime"},
    {"op": "focus",   "concept": "short films (under 90 min)"},
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "warm vs cold colour palette", "kind": "axis", "space": "visual"}
  ]
}
```

Example 4 — cross-filter by genre, then semantic axis:
```json
{
  "intent_description": "Keep only horror and thriller films, then separate the ones driven by psychological dread from those that rely on visceral shock.",
  "operations": [
    {"op": "cross_filter", "concept": "horror and thriller genre"},
    {"op": "cluster",      "concept": "psychological dread vs visceral shock", "kind": "axis", "space": "semantic"}
  ]
}
```

Example 5 — genre split, focus, then a semantic axis (the canonical form):
```json
{
  "intent_description": "Start by splitting the catalogue by genre, look more closely at drama films, and then explore how emotionally heavy vs restrained they are.",
  "operations": [
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "genre"},
    {"op": "focus",   "concept": "drama films"},
    {"op": "cluster", "concept": "emotionally overwhelming vs emotionally restrained", "kind": "axis", "space": "semantic"}
  ]
}
```

